            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "walkthrough:ck7gw",
          "html": "Perform a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lesser_essence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">lesser essence</a> ritual and collect <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Impure_essence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">impure essence</a> from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ritual_chest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ritual chest</a>. <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Malignius_Mortifer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Malignius Mortifer</a> will give you eight <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Basic_ghostly_ink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">basic ghostly ink</a>, four <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Regular_ghostly_ink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">regular ghostly ink</a>, and 200 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pure_essence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pure essence</a> for the lesser essence ritual.",
          "text": "Perform a lesser essence ritual and collect impure essence from the ritual chest. Malignius Mortifer will give you eight basic ghostly ink, four regular ghostly ink, and 200 pure essence for the lesser essence ritual.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "walkthrough:ck7gw:14iom2q",
              "html": "You need two <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Elemental_I\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Elemental I</a> glyphs, two <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Change_I\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Change I</a> glyphs, and four light sources.",
              "text": "You need two Elemental I glyphs, two Change I glyphs, and four light sources.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "walkthrough:1yd1z31",
